# Cyrillic fork local inputs/outputs -- these live in the REPO ROOT and must
# never be committed. /win98/ is the WIN98 folder extracted from the Russian
# Win98 SE CD ISO; the root-level patterns cover the QI ISO(s) and outputs.
/win98/
/*.[iI][sS][oO]
/*.[cC][aA][bB]
